       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. FJERN-OVERSKYENDE-MELLEMRUM.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 PREVIOUSCHAR     PIC X       VALUE SPACE.
       01 IX-READ          PIC 99      VALUE 1.
       01 IX-OUT           PIC 99      VALUE 1.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 OUTPUT-LINJE     PIC X(90).
       01 INPUT-LINJE       PIC X(90).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING OUTPUT-LINJE INPUT-LINJE.
       MOVE 1 TO IX-OUT
       PERFORM VARYING IX-READ FROM 1 BY 1 
               UNTIL IX-READ > LENGTH OF INPUT-LINJE
           IF PREVIOUSCHAR NOT = SPACE 
                   OR INPUT-LINJE(IX-READ:1) NOT = SPACE
               PERFORM IGNORE-SPACE-BEFORE-SPECIALCHARACTERS
               MOVE INPUT-LINJE(IX-READ:1) TO OUTPUT-LINJE(IX-OUT:1)
               ADD 1 TO IX-OUT
           END-IF
           MOVE INPUT-LINJE(IX-READ:1) TO PREVIOUSCHAR
       END-PERFORM
       EXIT PROGRAM.

       IGNORE-SPACE-BEFORE-SPECIALCHARACTERS.
       IF PREVIOUSCHAR = SPACE AND (
               INPUT-LINJE(IX-READ:1) = ',' OR
               INPUT-LINJE(IX-READ:1) = '.'
           )
           SUBTRACT 1 FROM IX-OUT
       END-IF.
